{"id":"ko-a1-l002","level":2,"language":"ko","supportLanguage":"zh_tw","revision":"3","status":"ai_reviewed","sourceId":"src.ko.lesson.a1-l002","title":null,"description":"在語言交流聚會上，兩位成人同輩 Jihun 和 Seoyeon 初次見面，互相介紹姓名與身分。Seoyeon 第一次參加這個聚會，她的姓名牌上寫著「서니」（Seoni）；Jihun 看到後，向她確認這個暱稱。兩人使用日常禮貌體（해요體）交談。這課先練習介紹、確認姓名與暱稱；主動請別人使用特定稱呼，留待之後學習。","blocks":[{"block_id":"l002.s1","block_type":"scene","speakers":["jihun","seoyeon"]},{"block_id":"l002.t01","block_type":"turn","speaker":"jihun","sentence_id":"ex.ko.s.ko-a1-l002.000001","knowledge":["ko.g.topic.aboutness#c01","ko.g.ida.identification#c02"]},{"block_id":"l002.t02","block_type":"turn","speaker":"seoyeon","sentence_id":"ex.ko.s.ko-a1-l002.000002","knowledge":["ko.g.topic.aboutness#c01","ko.g.ida.identification#c01","ko.g.address.social-choice#c01"]},{"block_id":"l002.t03","block_type":"turn","speaker":"jihun","sentence_id":"ex.ko.s.ko-a1-l002.000003","knowledge":["ko.g.address.social-choice#c02","ko.g.address.social-choice#c01"]},{"block_id":"l002.t04","block_type":"turn","speaker":"seoyeon","sentence_id":"ex.ko.s.ko-a1-l002.000004","knowledge":["ko.g.topic.aboutness#c01","ko.g.address.social-choice#c02"]},{"block_id":"l002.t05","block_type":"turn","speaker":"jihun","sentence_id":"ex.ko.s.ko-a1-l002.000005","knowledge":["ko.g.address.social-choice#c01","ko.g.topic.aboutness#c01","ko.g.address.social-choice#c02"]},{"block_id":"l002.t06","block_type":"turn","speaker":"seoyeon","sentence_id":"ex.ko.s.ko-a1-l002.000006","knowledge":["ko.g.address.social-choice#c01","ko.g.topic.aboutness#c01"]},{"block_id":"l002.t07","block_type":"turn","speaker":"jihun","sentence_id":"ex.ko.s.ko-a1-l002.000007","knowledge":["ko.g.address.social-choice#c02","ko.g.ida.identification#c02"]},{"block_id":"l002.t08","block_type":"turn","speaker":"seoyeon","sentence_id":"ex.ko.s.ko-a1-l002.000008","knowledge":["ko.g.ida.identification#c01"]},{"block_id":"l002.t09","block_type":"turn","speaker":"jihun","sentence_id":"ex.ko.s.ko-a1-l002.000009","knowledge"